docket 0.2.0b1

Real `docket harness run` invocation against a loopback server whose one
reply is a `bash` tool call running a command (`curl ... | sh`) that is not
on docket's own curated allowlist. Harness mode's approval posture is fixed
to non-interactive refusal, so the call is denied immediately as `blocked`
rather than waiting on a human. Exit code 1.
